erve what is in the heavens and the earth.\" But of no avail will be signs or warners to a people who do not believe.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":101,"sd":null},{"k":"10:102","t":"So do they wait except for like [what occurred in] the days of those who passed on before them? Say, \"Then wait; indeed, I am with you among those who wait.\"","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":102,"sd":null},{"k":"10:103","t":"Then We will save Our messengers and those who have believed. Thus, it is an obligation upon Us that We save the believers.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":103,"sd":null},{"k":"10:104","t":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"O people, if you are in doubt as to my religion - then I do not worship those which you worship besides Allāh; but I worship Allāh, who causes your death. And I have been commanded to be of the believers","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":104,"sd":null},{"k":"10:105","t":"And [commanded], 'Direct your face [i.e., self] toward the religion, inclining to truth, and never be of those who associate others with Allāh;","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":105,"sd":null},{"k":"10:106","t":"And do not invoke besides Allāh that which neither benefits you nor harms you, for if you did, then indeed you would be of the wrongdoers.'\"","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":106,"sd":null}],"juz":11,"hizb":22,"surahs":[10],"sajdah":false}